Root cause found — it's mine: the machine is under load, rAF runs ~27 fps, and my fixed 1500 ms wait after `ready` yields only ~40 frames, so the 61-frame program-count window never completes. The fix is frame-based waiting, plus context-loss taint detection and a resilient settled read. Applying.
